# Kite infra - cac bien de nap len GitHub (environment aws) o buoc 3.
# File nay chi chua TEN bien, khong chua gia tri.
# Gia tri that nam trong file .env (da bi .gitignore chan, khong commit),
# do script buoc 2 (terraform-bootstrap.sh) gom du ca 7 bien vao:
#   - AWS_*/TF_* tu terraform outputs;
#   - KITE_SSH_CIDR tu IP public hien tai, KITE_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY tu file key,
#     KITE_ACCESS/KITE_DOMAIN theo mac dinh (public / trong) neu chua dat.
AWS_ROLE_ARN=
AWS_REGION=
TF_STATE_BUCKET=
KITE_SSH_CIDR=
KITE_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY=
KITE_ACCESS=
KITE_DOMAIN=
